<human_speech><blue>Four generations in. Eighty of them, actually, if you count the ones that did not make the cut.<\blue><green>The ring board. Symmetric, six posts, no terrain. Nothing to hide behind.<\green><blue>It plays this board better than we do, <\blue><golden><shining>Blotto<\golden><\shining><blue>. It has played it many thousands of times.<\blue><green>You have played it once. Use that.<\green><\human_speech>
